h updates are pending for the other 33 (e.g. `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk` 1.22→1.31, `@opencode-ai/sdk` 1.0.78→1.18.33, `hono` 4.10→4.13, `zod` 4.1→4.6, `web-tree-sitter` 0.25→0.27, `test-anywhere` 0.7→0.9). The Rust crate under `rust/` is covered by the same rule.\\n\\n## Requirements\\n\\n1. R1: update every dependency to its latest release, majors included, adapting the code (the AI SDK 6→7 and provider 2→4 migrations touch the provider layer: list each breaking change handled in the pull request).\\n2. R2: the three own packages move to their latest releases; anything they lack that the agent needs is filed in their repositories.\\n3. R3: CI job that fails when anything is behind (`npm outdated` exits 1; `cargo outdated --root-deps-only --exit-code 1` for `rust/`), unless the pin line carries an open issue URL explaining the blocker.\\n4. R4: release the updated package; link-assistant/hive-mind bumps its pin (link-assistant/hive-mind#2324 R1 tracks the pin). Release reliability: #318.\\n\\n## How to test\\n\\n`npm outdated` in `js/` prints nothing; the full test suite and the Hive Mind `--tool agent` smoke run pass on the updated version.\\n\\n\",\"comments\":[],\"title\":\"Update all dependencies to their latest releases (59 behind, incl. ai 6->7, @ai-sdk 2->4, own command-stream 0.7->1.2, lino-objects-codec 0.1->0.8) and enforce it in CI\"}\n[{\"mergedAt\":\"2026-09-29T18:30:41Z\",\"number\":324,\"title\":\"fix(ci): recover npm releases after registry propagation delays\"},{\"mergedAt\":\"2026-09-29T17:48:01Z\",\"number\":321,\"title\":\"chore: update dependencies and enforce freshness\"},{\"mergedAt\":\"2026-09-28T06:23:07Z\",\"number\":316,\"title\":\"Keep other providers out of explicit --model runs; document the host config contract\"},{\"mergedAt\":\"2026-09-20T16:08:28Z\",\"number\":312,\"title\":\"Fix stream-json tool lifecycle events\"},{\"mergedAt\":\"2026-09-20T15:58:23Z\",\"number\":311,\"title\":\"fix: accept null Claude OAuth metadata\"},{\"mergedAt\":\"2026-09-14T03:51:38Z\",\"number\":308,\"title\":\"fix: session summaries and compaction follow --model; models can declare no context limit\"},{\"mergedAt\":\"2026-09-09T09:31:13Z\",\"number\":305,\"title\":\"fix: a failed session summary no longer fails the run\"},{\"mergedAt\":\"2026-09-02T06:43:53Z\",\"number\":302,\"title\":\"fix(ci): audit both pipelines for false positives, false negatives, warnings and errors\"},{\"mergedAt\":\"2026-09-01T19:43:01Z\",\"number\":300,\"title\":\"fix: share Git objects and prune orphan snapshots\"},{\"mergedAt\":\"2026-09-01T19:06:25Z\",\"number\":299,\"title\":\"0.25.0: floating `ai` range + `@ai-sdk/openai-compatible@^1` makes every tool call abort since ai@6.0.260\"}]\n[{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-30T10:08:22Z\",\"databaseId\":36700558729,\"headSha\":\"629…19b\",\"name\":\"Security\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"}]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
